5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry about the social friction if we make this too rigid.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I just want to know if the current spots are actually fair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is a mess. I need to see the physical flow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nobody ever checks the costs. I need to know the financial reality.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Who is actually doing the work? I need to see the effort involved.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
