35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The minutes show the same flats held covered spots for years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Four times a morning, someone had to shift a bike to leave.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ledger shows no capital work. The ward park is 2,600 yen.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The handover file logs three hours a month just for reconciliation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, if the ward park is cheaper, why not just use that?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, shifting bikes sounds exhausting. Is there a better way?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, the display frame took twenty seconds to load. It's slow.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the ward park has a waitlist. We can't rely on it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, three hours a month is a lot for one person.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The complaint log had nine notes about leaning bikes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The rain exposure is bad past the downpipe. Saddles stay wet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The display frame needs greasing twice a year. That's maintenance.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The ward park notice listed fourteen households waiting.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The neighbouring block had arrears and people stopped coming to meetings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, that sounds like a recipe for social breakdown.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, if the frame is slow, maybe we need more space?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, more space means more cost. I need to see the numbers.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, I agree. We need a system that doesn't break down.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, I am worried about the workload if we bill individually.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
