60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is paid. Option B is lottery. Option C is shared racks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C seems fairer. No one owns a spot.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C avoids the shifting problem. I like it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A brings in money. But the ward park is cheaper.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A adds three hours of work. I don't want that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I agree. Option B is too random. Option C is best.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, yes, Option C lets us use the dry spots first.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, but the display frame is slow. Is it worth it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the cost of the frame is high. But it saves space.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, if we don't bill, we don't need the handover work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Option C is the only one that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,Option C is the only one that is truly fair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Option C is the only one that works in the morning.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is the only one that doesn't cost extra.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option C is the only one that doesn't add work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
